This adds Brain's half to 020's server/director/passage.js (apply 020 first):
- studioPassageOf(beat, { page, lang }): the showPassage arguments for a "board" beat (null for "aloud").
- pageFor(beat, item, current): the page that holds the text the item quotes, else the current page. The page she is reading
